    "summary": "Tasks 1–6 passed. Task 7 now requires a one-use ReviewBootstrapFence before worker creation; timeout closes it synchronously and it remains non-reusable through lock/store reclaim. The review guard makes workerData.role non-writable/non-configurable before family imports, and the entrypoint freezes its review identity. Both code/design source and compiled bootstrap fixtures now execute a real fake-CLI request and binary shell request over the installed native hub contract, assert role mutation fails, and prove missing transport cannot spawn. Three required/supporting tests pass with clean typecheck. Registry connection remains t8; full family execution integration remains t9/t10. The 10 broader direct-Worker fixture loader failures reproduce unchanged on baseline 77a40780c.",
